## 14. Final Executive Summary

- **What this system really is:** Not a website. A three-sided acquisition engine that simultaneously drives patient demand, recruits imaging center supply, and captures employer B2B leads from a single, coherent codebase. Its health is the primary determinant of USRad's growth rate.

